      "71": {
        "attributes": {
          "font-size": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "TRANSPORT TICK    \n\nThe Transport Tick node i a more advanced version of the Transport Beat node. In this node you can manually set the multiplier of the beat and can  create odd and strange time signatures where needed. Press the play button in the transport bar to start the example.\n\nExample: In this example we've set the multiplier to 0.33 so that we roughly get a trigger on each third beat even though we are in 4/4 time.\nThe first triggers will be on the 1 and 4 of the first bar. Then on the 3 of the second bar, on the 2 of the thrid bar etc."
          }
        },
